:00:03:087   _on_button_pressed: Invalid access to property or key 'scene_changed' on a base object of type 'null instance'.\n  <GDScript Source>main.gd:6 @ _on_button_pressed()\n  <Stack Trace> main.gd:6 @ _on_button_pressed()\n```\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nPress a button to change current scene, for example:\n```GDScript\nfunc _on_button_pressed() -> void:\n\tget_tree().change_scene_to_packed(preload(\"res://scene.tscn\"))\n\tawait get_tree().scene_changed\n\tprint_debug(get_tree().current_scene.get_path())\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23759476/test.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"heppocogne","id":83043568,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzMDQzNTY4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83043568?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/heppocogne","html_url":"https://github.com/heppocogne","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heppocogne/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heppocogne/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heppocogne/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heppocogne/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heppocogne/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heppocogne/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heppocogne/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heppocogne/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heppocogne/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113173/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113173/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}